This setup includes the main plugin file `json_mode_witness_plugin.py`, the tick script `tick.py`, and two configuration files `schemas.json` and `styles.json`. The plugin simulates sending prompts to an LLM and validating responses against predefined schemas. Adjust the `_send_to_llm` method to interact with your actual LLM service.
